(Indonesia): On the morning of May 23, 2023, Dr. Kao Kim Hourn, Secretary-General of ASEAN, delivered a special speech on "Core of Growth" at the Opening Ceremony of the 18th Asian Media Summit. Go to Bali, Republic of Indonesia.
