Samdech Techo Hun Sen added that after dropping $ 30 million for the construction of the "Techo Aphivath" medical building, Samdech has made a movement to donate money for human life, and some philanthropists have also donated their own funds through 30 Cambodian People's Party. $ Million, raising the budget by $ 60 million, plus the government budget of $ 30 million.
