Samdech Techo Hun Sen added that the budget from philanthropists for the construction of Calmette Hospital has a total of 223 people, equivalent to 72 million dollars. Funds received for the construction of a treatment building and equipment at Calmette Hospital totaled 102.8 million dollars and 281 million riels.
This "Techo Aphiwat Building" can provide health services to about 250,000 patients per year. In addition, Techo Aphivath Building will be a training center for students to study and research medical technology in the country's leading digital systems.
