Samdech Techo reminded that Samdech has led Cambodia since defeating the Khmer Rouge at the age of 25 and has been the Minister of Foreign Affairs since the age of 27, the Prime Minister at the age of 32, and has been the Prime Minister for 38 years. More than half a year.
Samdech continued, "I have been the Prime Minister since I was 32 years old. I have been the Prime Minister for 38 years now, more than half of my life. "In the run-up to the election, please remain silent and let us use local rules to address democracy in Cambodia."
