(Phnom Penh): Mr. Prum Sokha, Minister of Public Works and Chairman of the Public Administration Reform Committee, gave a lecture on "Innovative Leadership and Public Administration in Public Administration" to students at the Royal University of Phnom Penh.
The ceremony took place on the morning of May 22, 2023 at the Cambodia-Korea Cooperation Center (CKCC) on the campus of the Royal University of Phnom Penh, with the participation of the leaders of the Ministry of Public Works and the Faculty of Management. And student monks of the Royal University of Phnom Penh, a total of nearly 700 participants.
