Announcing the appointment of Mr. Sao Vanna as the Director of the Department of National Assembly Senate Relations and Inspection of Svay Rieng Province to replace Mr. Soeng Sokhom who has retired
(Svay Rieng): Mr. Chhour Raksmey Rith, Secretary of State of the Ministry of National Assembly Senate Relations and Inspection, Representative of His Excellency Dr. Men Sam An, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister and Mr. Men Vibol, Governor of Svay Rieng Province, on the morning of May 22, 2023. Position: New Director of Svay Rieng Province.
The ceremony was attended by the delegates of the Ministry of National Assembly Senate Relations and Inspection, Deputy Governors, the directors of various provincial departments and units, representatives of the three forces and other relevant government officials.
He would like to propose to the newly appointed director of the department as well as the leaders and civil servants of the Department of National Assembly-Senate Relations and Provincial Inspection as follows:
* First, to continue to pay attention to increase cooperation and good relations with local administrations at all levels, departments, units and the armed forces of all kinds to contribute to the implementation of government policies, especially within the framework of Legal reform, strengthening good governance and the rule of law.
* Second, please continue to promote the implementation of the plan to disseminate education, laws and regulations that are relevant to the day-to-day operations, mainly related to the lives of the people, as well as the new standards that the Royal Government and ministries. Make it more active and comprehensive.
* Third: Continue to pay attention to strengthen the training to increase the capacity of civil servants in the profession, especially in the field of mechanisms and methods to be used to facilitate dispute resolution and inspection work, etc., in order to respond to new job requirements to ensure Sustain the work of the unit to run smoothly and better.
