In addition, there must be good internal unity, continue to make efforts to learn from good experiences combined with past experience, including new knowledge, skills, techniques to continue and promote better performance. In addition, to serve and provide public services to citizens with transparency, efficiency, accountability and high responsibility.
Please be informed that according to Proclamation No. 046/23, dated April 11, 2023, Mr. Sao Vanna has been appointed as the first level official of the Department of National Assembly-Senate Relations and Inspection in Svay Rieng Province. Soeng Sokhom, who has reached retirement age.
