(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of May 21, 2023, Samdech Kitti Sangkhab Dr. Men Sam An, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of National Assembly-Senate Relations and Inspection, representing Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, Presiding over the closing ceremony of the 30th Al Quran Anuk Karim and the 4th National Oral Recitation 2023 at Vihear Kilometer 9, Village 3, Sangkat Chrang Chamres I, Khan Russey Keo, Phnom Penh.
