Speaking on that occasion, Senior Minister Ly Thuch said that we must always remember and be grateful to Samdech Techo, President of the People's Party and the People's Party for liberating the country and the people from the genocidal regime, leading the country with one hand. Leading the country and the other hand, defending the country and preventing the return of the genocidal regime, and our country is further besieged economically.
Senior Minister Ly Thuch requested that all members support and join the CPP in order to participate in the protection of peace, which Samdech Techo Prime Minister, President of the Cambodian People's Party has changed his life and struggled the most.
He also expressed his appreciation and gratitude to the new members who made the right decision to join the political life with the CPP, because only the CPP has brought peace, development, especially job creation. Richly available to all of us.
Finally, the Senior Minister, on behalf of Samdech Kittisangha Men Sam An, Vice President of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Svay Rieng Local Strengthening Working Group, would like to express his deep gratitude to all members and leaders of the Bavet City People's Party. Twenty Candlelight Party Activists at Toul Sophy Beehive in Tbong Khmum Province Dropped Party Labels and Decided to Join the CPP
