(Kratie): On the morning of May 21, 2023, Mr. Vath Thorn, Governor of Kratie Province, cut the examination package of Civil Servants of Kratie Province's O'Kreang Senchey District Administration out of 13 candidates out of 453 high school candidates. Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Kratie City.
Mr. Vathon stated that the current civil service examination is conducted in a transparent and highly responsible manner by all officials as jurors and caretakers. It is important that all female candidates use their personal abilities. Exactly.
The provincial governor instructed the candidates to work hard to do a good job, and those who know will pass. After passing the exam, he must use his knowledge to serve the people well in order to develop the district and commune to be more prosperous, not partisan, and he wished all the candidates success.
At the same time, Mr. Vathon further instructed the officials who have the roles and responsibilities in the civil service examination to enter the framework within the district administration to pay attention to perform their duties and responsibilities better.
It should be noted that there are 453 candidates in the list of civil servants of the Ministry of Interior, 262 females, of which 84 are senior administrative officers / 32 females, and 94 are kramas / 56 females. 275 administrative secretaries / 174 women. Fishermen drive a boat and sink a guard boat into a river in Chit Borei district while patrolling and banning the installation of fishing nets in the dolphin conservation area
(Kratie): A fisherman drives a boat, crashes into a river guard boat and disappears into the Mekong River during a patrol and instructs him not to place a fishing rod in a dolphin conservation area. This incident happened on the night of May 20, 2023 in Sambok commune, Chit Borey district, Kratie province.
At that time, the team instructed the suspect to leave the fishing line, but the suspect replied that Samdech Techo had announced to put the hook back, and despite the river guards trying to explain that this area is a protected area for the banned dolphins. Using a fishing rod, the suspect used inappropriate words and insulted the river guards.
The above exhibits were temporarily stored by the river guards at the Kampi Dolphin River Conservation Post to prepare a file to be sent to the upper level for comment. The suspect escaped and the police force of Sambok Administration Post, Chit Borei District is searching for the suspect to bring him to justice. Kampong Speu Provincial Governor Tells Candidates for Civil Servants Exam After Succeeding to Serve the People
(Kampong Speu): On the morning of May 21, 2023, Mr. Vy Samnang, Governor of Kampong Speu Province, together with the working group of the Speakers Committee, cut the examination package for civil servants of the Ministry of Interior for Kampong Speu Province. There were 369 candidates who applied for the exam, including 197 females.
Mr. Vy Samnang said during the cut of the test package that all candidates must take the real skills learned from the exam now to the best of their ability (those who know are passed). After the successful exam, we must strive to serve the people and develop the villages, communes, districts, and provinces to be more prosperous.
The Governor of Kampong Speu Province emphasized that the candidates who have entered the public service must fulfill their roles and responsibilities with the utmost honesty and must not be partisan in the state unit.
