Minister Mam Bunheng Condolences the Death of Mr. Lek Sandy, Former Director of the Malaria Control Center of the Ministry of Health
(Phnom Penh): Professor Mam Bunheng, Minister of Health, on May 21, 2023, sent a message of condolences to Mr. Lek Disouly on the death of Mr. Lek Sandy, former Director of the Malaria Control Center of the Ministry of Health.
"We, the leaders, civil servants and staff of the Ministry of Health, are deeply saddened and saddened to learn that Professor Lek Sandy, former director of the Malaria Control Center of the Ministry of Health, has passed away on Thursday 14 Roch. Pisak month, Chhnang Thao, Panchasak, B.C. 2567 is on May 18, 2023 at 8:30 in the morning at the age of 84 years old.
The death of Professor Lek Sandy is the loss of a health intellectual and a pious father and grandfather.
We extend our heartfelt condolences to Professor Lek Dysoli and his wife, sons, daughters and the entire family of the deceased. We all dedicate ourselves to praying for the soul of Professor Lek Sandy to be born in peace, not to be buried. "
It should be informed that Mr. Lek Sandy's 7-day cover ceremony will be held on May 23, 2023 at Veal Sbov pagoda in Veal Sbov commune, Chbar Ampov district, Phnom Penh.
