At the same time, the Battambang Provincial Police has called on people not to be confused and to stop distributing this case in a different sense, as found in the research. Phnom Penh Capital Hall Organizes Civil Servants Recruitment Exam for 2023, More Than 2,000 Candidates
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of May 21, 2023, the Phnom Penh Capital Administration selected Chea Sim Santhor Mok High School as the examination center for candidates to work in the civil service of Phnom Penh Capital Administration for 2023 according to the decision of Ministry of Interior.
The Phnom Penh Capital Administration has also assigned civil servants to participate as members of eight committees and sub-committees to be responsible for their respective duties in the examination center.
The examination was conducted with the participation of Mr. El Bunthol, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Public Function, Mr. Loam Leng Vy, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Interior, Mr. Keut Chhe, Deputy Governor, representing Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh and Chairman of the Organizing Committee. Phnom Penh exam.
The exam session was held for one morning with 2,244 female candidates, 1,002 of whom were female, equal to 91 rooms. According to the jury, the framework is divided into three categories:
Office of the Ministry of Interior: 15 senior administrative officers were selected out of 450 candidates for the exam, 15 out of 489 candidates were selected from the executive committee, and 10 out of 656 candidates were selected as administrative secretaries.
* Phnom Penh Capital Hall has 5 senior administrative officers selected out of 141 candidates: 5 out of 160 candidates applied for the examination, 5 administrative secretaries are selected. Out of 348 candidates.
For the examination of senior administrative officers in specialized subjects and English for 2 hours, the framework of the code for officers in the examination of specialized subjects and English for 2 hours.
For the framework of the Secretary of Administration, the examination on general knowledge, administrative work knowledge and knowledge in the field of public functions lasts for the same 2 hours.
The Civil Servants Selection Examination at the Sub-National Administration is held annually to meet the necessary requirements of the duties and responsibilities, and all female candidates are selected from the students who have passed the examination from High school level up.
