The 149 new members read out the application to join the CPP with political life, seeing that the patriotic ideals dare to sacrifice everything for the cause of the Cambodian People's Party and the right and wise leadership. Samdech Techo Hun Sen's Doctor has brought peace and development to the country, making people believe in the leadership of the Cambodian people.
Former leaders and members of the Candlelight Party continued that in all circumstances, the CPP has always been with the people to help solve the needs of the people in a timely manner. Therefore, we all believe and trust the Cambodian People's Party as a party that can participate in political life and contribute to the development of the nation and improve the lives of the people to grow more.
At the same time, Mr. Nuth Puth Dara said that the decision to join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party is the right decision to show understanding and desire for peace and further development. The Cambodian People's Party warmly welcomes the active members of all parties of all political tendencies who want to live with the CPP to jointly build and develop our country to be more prosperous.
In addition, the Prime Minister also made Cambodia's image on the international stage through the successful fight against Kovid 19 and recently hosted the ASEAN Summit and Events. The 32nd Southeast Asian Games in Cambodia show the world the national prestige of Cambodia.
Mr. Nuth Puth Dara instructed the new members to perform their duties according to the statute of the Cambodian People's Party, including:
* First, strive to properly implement the party's political program and statutes * Second: Build good relations with the people and strive to disseminate the political program of the party, state law to the people * Third: To maintain unity Internal unity, keeping party secrets, always helping each other for progress * Fourth: Strive to learn, enhance capacity and virtue to fulfill the tasks for the motherland.
