After meeting the flower boy, Dr. Hun Manet decided to help the boy Run Phearum and his sister to get higher education and help their parents change their business for the better
(Battambang): As promised, Dr. Hun Manet met in person, a flower boy in Battambang province, Run Phearum and his family, after examining the possibility of helping this boy and his family to have a business Better living conditions.
According to the information posted on the official social network of Dr. Hun Manet on the morning of May 20, 2023, Dr. decided to help the boy Run Phearum and his sister to get higher education and help their parents change their career Better yet.
Dr. HUN Manet posted the full content as follows: "After following my principles, the working group of the Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo Hun Sen Scholarship Student Association and Samdech Kittiprittbandit (AMT) Battambang Province found you Prun Run Phearum, alias Arai (a florist I met in Battambang last week) and his family and took some help to give him a step, I promised to find time to meet them later.
This evening, when I had to go to work in a nearby province, I asked the team to bring my nephew and his family to see me to find out more about his family situation and to explore the possibility of helping them.
I commend the brothers and sisters who are the parents of your children, who, despite their poor living conditions, have educated their children well, to work hard, to persevere and to adhere to virtue, morality and righteousness from an early age. I would also like to commend nephew Run Phearum for his courage, responsibility and help in caring for his parents since he was 6 years old (he is now 13 years old).
After finding out about his family situation, I decided:
1: Help provide the means and possibilities for his parents to adjust their business to increase family income
2: Help nephew Run Phearum and his sister to attend the school they want to study until the end of 12th grade and plan to provide scholarships to continue their studies in higher education so that they can build their capacity and Participate in helping our family and society in the future.
I would also like to thank Mr. Lim Kunvuth and the members of the Battambang Provincial AMT team for finding their nephew and family and facilitating this meeting. ”
