Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of handing over diplomas to more than 1,000 medical students
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Thursday, May 18, 2023, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, presided over the graduation ceremony for medical students. 1,396 from the University of Health Sciences. The ceremony took place at Sokha Hotel, Phnom Penh.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech at about 1:30, the following is the main content of Samdech:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech was really happy to come and distribute diplomas to medical students.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that today's winning medical student is another new achievement in the field of health.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was proud of Cambodia's progress in the field of health care at a time when the past was very difficult.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commends the Ministry of Health, the University, as well as all the professors who have overcome the difficulties of creating human resources in the health sector.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that compared to the beginning of Cambodia after the Khmer Rouge regime, the current health situation of Cambodia has improved a lot.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has survived the war, the famine, but the disease may be difficult to overcome.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that climate change has brought many new diseases that require the development of medical capacity.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked doctors who graduated today volunteered to take part in the fight against Kovid 19 in the past.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is a country where foreign friends send people to experiment. Not just the health sector, but many more.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is happy to receive and explore Cambodia's success from all scholars.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that some developed countries have underestimated the epidemic of Kovid 19. Other countries underestimated poor countries in the fight against Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that some rich countries could not find Kovid 19 vaccine to give to the people because it was too late to decide which source to supply the vaccine.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that there is a vaccine that can not control Kovid 19 if the vaccination measures are not correct.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminds doctors to receive a degree today to maintain the reputation of "white army" by strengthening the professional ethics of doctors.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he regrets the spending of countries to produce weapons that destroy human life.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants Cambodia to study the production of artificial eyes using Japanese techniques.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it was the right decision not to take money in the SEA Games.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's reputation from hosting the SEA Games will remain for the next 100 years.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen incited the opposition to insult Khmer stars. Cursing Cambodian stars is tantamount to creating conflicts with those star fans as well.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his great pleasure for organizing the SEA Games.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praises the ability of Cambodian volleyball players.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the closing of the SEA Games is like removing a thorn from the chest as a person with high responsibility for leading the state.
