In addition, the Honorary Doctor also called on all veterans to be united, respectful, love and help each other like brothers and sisters in the same family. At the same time, we must sincerely support the leadership of Samdech Techo, the head of the Royal Government and the President of the Cambodian Veterans Association, and be committed to safeguarding the peace that comes from the great sacrifices of the people under Samdech Techo's win-win policy.
