In addition, a senior official of the Ministry of Environment would like to thank the people who reported the news of the sale of wildlife meat to professional officials to take timely action, he said: "Most people are aware of. "The importance of wildlife for the planet and the ecosystem, and love of wildlife, participation in the protection and conservation of wildlife, and co-reporting cases of illegal wildlife trade."
Mr. Neth Pheaktra praised the Cambodian people who love wildlife and participate in protecting and conserving wildlife.
