Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of awarding diplomas to more than 3,000 agricultural students
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Monday, May 15, 2023, the Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen presided over the graduation ceremony for graduates. More than 3,000 people in the agricultural sector. The event was held at the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for about 2 hours, the following are the main contents of Samdech:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the agricultural sector is still the core sector to support the national economy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the developed countries in the world, agriculture has a low share in the national economy, but they can support the consumption of the people and export abroad.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the low level of agriculture in the national economy, but does not mean that the agricultural sector is shrinking.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the children of the opposition party are not as bright as the bosses, now they are running to live with the CPP one after another.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen welcomes all members of the opposition, except for one individual.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the policy of deploying agricultural officials to communes will help improve the agricultural sector.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that overthrowing the Khmer Rouge, seeking peace and political and economic reform were all Samdech "heads" to change.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that Samdech has no habit of grabbing anyone's work. Therefore, let others not come to seize Samdech's work.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there is no development that is not environmentally degraded. However, efforts must be made to protect forests from the spread of agriculture.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that while finding a source of water, it is necessary to make efforts to provide good seeds to farmers for cultivation to get good results.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the establishment of farmers' associations is very important in negotiating prices with traders.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed the expectation that relations between Cambodia and Timor-Leste would remain good despite the change of leadership. Samdech Techo stated that Cambodia has made great efforts to bring Timor-Leste to ASEAN.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the agricultural sector in Cambodia has many technical problems. Samdech Techo encourages attention to technical work.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the price of agricultural products fell due to weak protests with traders.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if farmers do not change their habits in using seeds, they will not be able to get high yields.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges consideration to reduce farmers' production costs to increase competitiveness.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia was successful in the SEA Games. Cambodia does not focus on winning or losing, but on the happiness and welcome of the people to the sports delegation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he received thanks from various heads of government for not taking money from sports delegates.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that hosting the SEA Games is more difficult than chairing ASEAN.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh for leading the competition well.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the foundation of the SEA Games will now be a valuable legacy for future generations.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that about 80 percent of the people who were shocked by the SEA Games.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the SEA Games do not belong to the Cambodian People's Party, but to the achievements of the whole nation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that sports delegates from all over enjoy the SEA Games in Cambodia and that Cambodians know how to watch sports.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen allows SEA Games delegates to visit Angkor for free.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the SEA Games event made Samdech unexpectedly Cambodia today.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked Southeast Asian countries for supporting and sending delegates to the SEA Games in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanks the Chinese government and people for providing a beautiful and strong stadium for the SEA Games.
