(Phnom Penh): Major General Sambath Sothearoth, Kep Provincial Police Commissioner, through a press conference of the Royal Government Spokesperson's Unit on May 11, 2023, shared an experience that occurred in his locality by a group of perpetrators. Turned murder into a traffic accident to mislead authorities.
At the press conference on "Five Years of Success of Kep Provincial Administration", Major General Sambath Sothearoth emphasized that although the perpetrators turned the story around to defraud the authorities, but under the careful research of The specialized police force of Kep Provincial Police has successfully dismantled the case and arrested the perpetrators and a total of seven people involved for legal action.
On March 6, 2023, the relatives of the victims suspected that the death of the victim was not due to a traffic accident, they came to file a complaint at the police station in Damnak Chang Eur district. After receiving complaints from the relatives of the victims, the police force of the specialized office cooperated in investigating and arrested the seven suspects on March 11, 2023.
Listen to the remarks of Kep Provincial Police Commissioner: The Minister of Environment gave a lecture on "Environmental Management and Natural Resources in Cambodia" to the participants at the Cambodia-Vietnam Friendship National Police School
(Kampong Speu): Mr. Say Sam Al, Minister of Environment, on the afternoon of May 11, 2023, gave a lecture on "Management of the Environment and Natural Resources in Cambodia" to the trainees at the basic training of Police Vocational and Technical Training at the Police School. 237 Cambodian-Vietnamese nationals are located in Treng Trayeung commune, Phnom Sruoch district, Kampong Speu province.
After Lt. Gen. Un On, Deputy Chief of Staff and Director of the Cambodia-Vietnam Friendship National Police School, read out the welcome report and highlighted some of the school's difficulties, Mr. Say Sam Al, Minister of Environment, gave a lecture on "Environmental Management." And natural resources in Cambodia ", citing" peace, political stability and macroeconomic stability have enabled the Ministry of Environment to achieve many achievements. "
He added that the peace factor has led Cambodians to shift from a complete reliance on natural resources to traditional family farming to industrial, mechanized and artificial intelligence, and have changed positive attitudes and practices. Environmental friendliness.
According to Minister Say Samal, the Ministry of Environment, as the Secretary of the Royal Government of Cambodia in the field of environment, has a mission to lead and manage environmental protection, protection of natural resources, natural resources, biodiversity conservation and sustainable living. He stressed that the Ministry of Environment has six main areas:
* First, the General Department of Policy: Draws environmental policies in line with the policies and strategies of the Royal Government to contribute to the right decision.
* Second: General Department of Administration and Finance: Support the operation of the Ministry of Modern Administration to ensure the coordination of equipment, means of transportation to other General Departments.
* Third: General Department of Local Communities: To improve the livelihood of the community through the provision of animal breeds and vegetable varieties and follow the recommendations of Samdech Techo "Export on the spot" to promote ecotourism in the community "Ecological balance and livelihood. Our people are sustainable »
* Fourth: General Department of Protected Areas: Promote the work of demarcating, registering and marking state lands in protected areas.
* Fifth: Director General of the Department of Environmental Protection: Check the quality of land, air and garbage work in close proximity with the sub-national administration to determine the collection service, transportation, management of garbage collection system, landfill to make it easier with business owners. Handicrafts for all kinds of waste processing and scrap metal, how to reduce waste as much as possible
* Sixth: General Department of Environmental Knowledge and Information, disseminating education, raising public awareness and promoting the implementation of environmental friendliness through beautiful pictures and videos, "Tourism Seals the Land" and "Patriotism knows the land".
