The meeting was held on the afternoon of May 11, 2023 at the Ministry of Health. To begin, the Minister of Health extended a warm welcome to the Head of Delegation and thanked the Czech government and people for their participation. Support the health sector through a number of projects in Cambodia.
These projects include: * Memorandum of Understanding between the Ministry of Health of Cambodia and the Embassy of the Czech Republic on infant health protection of the National Children's Hospital.
* Construction of 3 health centers: Ream Anteuk Health Center, Thla Prachum Health Center and Trapeang Kranhung Health Center and Maternity Building in Koh Andet Referral Hospital, and Training of Health Officers in Takeo Province, using the funds to convert Cambodian debt into grants.
* Project to provide medical equipment to save the life of newborns, including training for the National Children's Hospital.
