According to a letter from Puth Theavy's lawyer, in the past and recently, a number of criminals have stolen the water clock of the client, which has affected the interests of the client and the Phnom Penh Water Supply Authority.
In order to prevent and prevent the above crimes, he announced to the people who are using the clean water of the Phnom Penh Water Supply Authority to provide information and cooperate with the unit to prevent crimes by harming the interests of customers and Unit. Police in Phnom Penh arrested and sent to court (Video inside)
(Phnom Penh): At almost 12 o'clock on May 5, 2023, there were two cases of civilians riding a motorbike, one of them took off his shirt and the other wearing shorts, and arrested and searched people for drugs in Along 1986 Street, Sangkat Phnom Penh Thmey, Khan Sen Sok, causing public criticism on Facebook and seeking confirmation of the composition of these two people, which side is the authority?
The suspect, 38-year-old Pich Niwat, a civilian with a false occupation, admitted that he had indeed forged military and military police uniforms to stop people on the street, search for drugs and threaten to extort money. Indeed, by acting with another faction, Ki has now escaped.
The suspect is currently being investigated by the Phnom Penh Anti-Criminal Bureau of the Phnom Penh Municipal Gendarmerie. Authorities are still searching for the fugitives.
