Four Poor Families Retired from Prey Veng Provincial Public Works Department Receive Donations from Provincial Leaders
(Prey Veng): Four poor families who are retirees of Prey Veng Provincial Department of Public Works and Transport received humanitarian donations in the form of food and some funds from the provincial leadership through Mr. Chheang Sovannara, Deputy Governor of Prey Veng Province, together with Mr. Mamny Bandith, Governor. Prey Veng City.
Mr. Chheang Sovannara sent a message of greetings and memories from the provincial leaders, including Mr. Chea Somethy, Governor of Prey Veng Province, who always takes care of the people in all circumstances, no matter what the situation.
The deputy governor also added that all these materials and budget, although not able to meet the needs of the people in the long run, but it can help alleviate the suffering of the people at the same time.
At the same time, the Deputy Governor also instructed the retired families of the Department of Public Works to take care of their own health and to live clean, eat clean, drink clean regularly to keep their health strong.
