Ministry of Environment, Kampong Speu Province and partners hold a joint conference before the opening day of the Second Zero Trap Campaign
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Environment, Kampong Speu Provincial Administration and partner organizations on the afternoon of May 08, 2023, held a joint press conference before the opening day of the Second Trap Zero Campaign at the Natural Resource Protection Area in Kampong Speu Province.
The launch of the Zero Campaign aims to reduce and prevent the number of traps in protected areas in Kampong Speu, as well as in protected areas in Cambodia, and to cultivate a greater love of wildlife among the public.
