(Phnom Penh): Mr. Tha Yav, Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Stong Immigration Working Group, said that the Cambodian People's Party always welcomes people who sincerely volunteer to join the Cambodian People's Party. .
