NEC: 13 days, 8 political parties to be officially recognized while 6 other parties are under scrutiny for voting
(Phnom Penh): Preliminary results of the registration of political parties and the list of candidates for the 7th National Assembly election as of May 6, 2023 at 5:30 pm, there are 14 political parties. Eight parties have been officially registered by the NEC and six others are under review.
The eight political parties that have been officially recognized include:
First: Cambodian People's Party Second: Cambodian Youth Party Third: Khmer United National Party Four: Theosophical Party Fifth: Democratic Forces Party Six: Cambodian Nationality Party Seventh: One Khmer Party Eight: Khmer Conservative Party
While six other political parties are reviewing, including:
First: FUNCINPEC, second: Beehive Social Democratic Party, third: Khmer National Unity Party, fourth: Citizens' Will Party, fifth: Women's Party for Women, and sixth: Khmer Anti-Poverty Party.
