(Banteay Meanchey): The Banteay Meanchey Provincial Administration and its three units, the Armed Forces, the Provincial Police Commissioner and the Buddhist Armed Forces, and hundreds of people, on May 5, 2023, participated in the Vesak Festival at Wat Chamkar Knor in O'Ambel Village, Sangkat O'Ambel, Serey Sophorn City, Banteay Meanchey Province.
