The joint commitment of the directors of the two provincial health departments was made on May 3, 2023 at a meeting on health cooperation along the Cambodian-Thai border between the Choam Ksan Referral Hospital of the Preah Vihear Provincial Health Department. And Nam Yeun Hospital of Ubon Ratchathani Provincial Health Department, Thailand.
The meeting focused on the agenda, including:
* Infectious disease surveillance system * Organizes joint exercises on rescue in case of traffic accident with many victims * On training of health workers * Referral system
