(Phnom Penh): Mr. Pan Sosak, Minister of Commerce, expressed the expectation that the new Ambassador of South Korea will push the trade volume between Cambodia and South Korea even higher.
During the courtesy call and discussion between Mr. Pan Sosak and Mr. PARK JUNG-WOOK, the newly appointed Ambassador of the Republic of Korea to Cambodia on May 3, 2023, discussed and exchanged views on strengthening Bilateral trade and economic relations and cooperation.
