(Phnom Penh): Mr. Keo Remy, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister and Chairman of the Cambodian Human Rights Committee, has decided to provide the Taekwondo-ITF Coach to assist in training and coaching people in the "My Opportunity Center" after the SEA Games. 32. To be healthy and physically fit and able to integrate into society and live together with family.
