(Phnom Penh): His Excellency Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Economy and Finance, would like to extend his heartfelt congratulations to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the occasion of receiving the honorary title of "Buddha Governor" and his doctorate degree. Honors for "Humanities and Solidarity" on the morning of May 2, 2023.
The title of "Buddhist Governor" received by Samdech Techo from the World Buddhist Organization, representing 55 countries of Buddhism at this time, is a recognition of Samdech Techo's lifelong devotion to peace and Buddhism.
Honorary Doctorate "Humanities and Solidarity" degree obtained by Samdech Techo PM at Negeri Padang University of Indonesia for the following reasons:
1: Samdech Techo Hun Sen sacrificed his life to liberate the Cambodian people from the dark era between 1975 and 1979, achieving peace and national unity, ensuring continuous change and development in Cambodia And raised the image of Cambodia back to the global stage.
2. Under the leadership of Samdech Techo Prime Minister, Samdech has strengthened governance through successful and fruitful reforms, with which Samdech has provided a new impetus to policy, democracy, rule of law, social and economic justice. Given equal opportunities for the Cambodian people.
Remarkably, Samdech Techo showed that peace can be achieved only through peaceful means, such as open and inclusive negotiations and win-win policies, and through ownership of issues and seeking The national solution itself. As a result, Cambodia is not only known as the Peace Island in the Mekong region, but is also known as a "small country with a wide heart."
3: Samdech Techo Hun Sen has made significant contributions to the field of humanitarianism and solidarity, including: a) Prioritizing attention to ethnic minorities in Cambodia, b) Promoting tolerance in In religion and c) policy on freedom of religion
4: Based on the governance and based on the study, it can be understood that Samdech Techo Hun Sen has met the conditions as stated in the Ministry Prakas on Research, Technology and Higher Education No. 65, 2016 on the honorary doctorate degree. And Regulation of the Rector of Padang State University No. 3, 2017 regarding the procedure for awarding an honorary doctorate degree (Doctor Honoris Causa) at Padang State University.
The awarding of an honorary doctorate is a recognition of Samdech Techo Hun Sen's outstanding achievements in leading, building and developing Cambodian society for the growth and prosperity of its people. An honorary doctorate degree is highly valued by the Prime Minister's unique guide as a great leader and builder of Cambodian society.
