The Deputy Prime Minister expressed his pleasure to meet the local people of Saang district again with the inauguration of this important achievement in an atmosphere of fresh smile and peace that Cambodia has while some countries in the world are receiving Under the war, escaped the shells.
He said that Cambodia under the right leadership of Samdech Techo Prime Minister Hun Sen, we have peace, we have time to build many achievements for the benefit of the people and have time to meet and inaugurate the school together happily. This peace is very valuable for every citizen.
With the education sector, he thanked the teachers who worked hard to teach students, because this career as a teacher is very valuable, providing knowledge to everyone to be able to build a family life, build a society. Better. We have a good school and we ask our students to study hard, especially all the people to take care of this achievement for the benefit of our children to use for a long time.
