Through this first meeting, General Ith Sarath strongly hopes that the Commission on Cooperation and Security along the Cambodia-Laos border, especially the troops stationed along the border of our two countries, will be able to implement it. Well, in accordance with the recommendations of the Prime Ministers of both countries.
The two sides also agreed to cooperate with local authorities and relevant officials to educate people living along the two countries' borders to understand the laws and regulations of each country, to avoid committing crimes and violations. Affect security along the border between the two countries.
Finally, the two sides also agreed to hold a bilateral meeting between the two countries' commission Laos-Cambodia in the Kingdom of Cambodia in 2024.
