The World Buddhist Organization emphasizes that with the revival of Buddhism in Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen has led Cambodia in accordance with the teachings of Buddhism on the path of nation-building and through win-win politics. In addition, Samdech Techo has brought back the people prosperity, complete peace, social and religious harmony, environmentally friendly and sustainable development.
