"Buddhism" is an honor bestowed on the top leaders of both the empire and the Buddhist leadership, who manage, maintain, obey, support and uphold the values of Buddhism with sincerity, purity and exaltation through Buddhist activities. Including the activities of the World Buddhist Organization.
"Buddha" is an title given to the king and his royal family and has the same meaning as "Buddha" used for the leadership of the empire.
