(Kampong Cham): The Cambodian People's Party (CPP) in Kampong Cham province has announced the addition of 760 new members from 522 Veal Vong and 238 Kampong Cham communes to join forces to win the upcoming general election, as well as Build a prosperous party life, protect existing achievements and build more for the party as well as the local people.
The induction ceremony was held on the morning of May 1, 2023 at Suon Kranhong House in Ta Neng Village, Sangkat Sambour Meas, Kampong Cham City, presided over by Mr. Un Chanda, Chairman of Kampong Cham Provincial People's Committee.
Mr. Un Chanda said that building party members at the grassroots level is an important task, that is, to increase the focus on doing good to their party members, including the general public. Because even if some people do not join the CPP, it does not mean that they do not vote for the CPP, so local party officials must do good deeds for them.
He added that the local party must also be prepared to propagate the party's policies to the people in the towns and to respond to the attack on the CPP.
