(Phnom Penh): At least 36 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on April 30, 2023 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News on May 1, 2023.
