Samdech Techo Hun Sen: The implementation of the law on trade unions continues to promote the freedom of professional organizations, as of the first quarter, 6,064 registered professional organizations in Cambodia
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, stated in his message on the 137th anniversary of International Labor Day on May 1, 2023 that as of the first quarter of 2023, professional organizations have registered. Significant increase with a total of 6,064 units.
