(Kiev) - Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky has claimed that he personally asked Chinese President Xi Jinping to rescue many Ukrainian children who have been forcibly repatriated to Russia. This was released by the AFP news agency on Saturday, April 29, 2023.
