He added that in 2022, Cambodia has already received about 2.2 million international tourists, and in the first quarter of 2023, Cambodia has already received about 1.2 million international tourists. In 2023, if there were no SEA Games, Cambodia would have received about 4 million international tourists, and when the SEA Games are held, Cambodia will receive even more international tourists.
