The Royal Government of Cambodia will pay subsidies to vulnerable families during the inflationary pressures again on July 10, 2023
(Phnom Penh): The Royal Government of Cambodia will pay subsidies to vulnerable families during the inflationary pressures again on July 10, 2023. This was stated by Mr. Ros Silva, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Economy and Finance and Chairman of the Executive Committee of the National Council for Social Protection on April 28, 2023.
In addition, the Royal Government of Cambodia will continue to provide cash to people from another program to vulnerable families in the face of inflationary pressures of more than 500,000 more families, which will help ease the burden of people's livelihoods and build resilience. The heavier the society, the stronger it gets to another level.
He invited the people who are already at risk by the authorities and the Ministry of Planning to pay again from the Royal Government of Cambodia on July 10, 2023, a program to provide cash to vulnerable families in During the period of inflationary pressure, after the first opening on December 10, 2022 and the second on April 10, 2023, and the third on July 10, 2023. .
