Please be informed that the Deputy Governor of Bokor City, Kim Panha, was summoned by the Kampot Provincial Police on April 26, 2023, after posting his wife's message that he had used domestic violence by beating his wife. Body. After being summoned, Mr. Kim Panha appeared at the Kampot City Police Inspectorate.
