Mr. You Serey Vuth told workers that the Cambodian People's Party is the only party to ensure national security and the people
(Kandal): Mr. You Serey Vuth, Chairman of the Working Group on Party Members in the Factory Workers in Kandal Province, told the workers that the Cambodian People's Party is the only party that can ensure the peace of the nation and the people. Cambodia.
Mr. You Serey Vuth highlighted this during a meeting with about 1,500 NagaPis factory in front of Samrong Thom Industrial Park in Kien Svay District, Kandal Province on Thursday afternoon, April 27, 2023. The ceremony was also attended by Mr. Phen Phalla, Deputy Chairman of the Working Group on Party Members in the Factory Workers in Kandal Province, and Mr. Mom Seak, Deputy Chairman, as well as a number of member working groups.
In front of a large number of workers, Mr. You Serey highlighted that the Cambodian People's Party is a mature political party with a strong leadership structure and clear policies on national leadership. In particular, many achievements have been made in nation building and development over the past 40 years after liberation from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot.
"The CPP is the backbone of the nation," he said. "The Cambodian People's Party has led the country through many stages and has gone through countless difficulties under the wise and skillful leadership of the nation and the people of Samdech Techo Hun Sen." This is the emphasis of Mr. You Sereyvuth.
Mr. You Serey Vuth added, "The Cambodian People's Party still has a core and very important role for the life of the nation and the Cambodian people as a whole, because the Cambodian People's Party is a large political party strong enough to protect the foundations, protect peace and justice. The well-being of the Cambodian people. ”
Addressing the potential and values of the Cambodian People's Party, which has been leading the country for more than 40 years, Mr. You Serey Vuth called on all workers to vote for the Cambodian People's Party on July 23, 2023. Coming soon.
