Ministry of Labor organizes the 6th National Technical and Vocational Education and Training Day 2023 under the theme "TVET provides appropriate skills and jobs"
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training will organize the 6th National Technical and Vocational Education and Training Day 2023 under the theme "TVET Provides Skills and Decent Work" which will take place from 15 to 16 June 2023 at Koh Pich Trade Fair Building, Phnom Penh.
National Technical and Vocational Education and Training Day is organized to promote the importance of technical and vocational education and training to students, youth, parents, guardians, the public and enterprises, industrial establishments, private companies, national and international organizations.
The Ministry will organize exhibitions of technical and vocational education and training students, the private sector and other relevant sectors, especially on the opening day of the 6th National Technical and Vocational Education and Training Day 2023, will be invited by the high chair of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen.
