Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of closing and opening the training course for civil servants at the Royal School of Administration
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Thursday, April 27, 2023, the Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen presided over the closing and opening ceremony of a training course for civil servants in Phnom Penh. Royal School of Administration. The closing and opening ceremony of this training course took place at the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center.
On that occasion, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for more than 1 hour and 30 minutes, the following are the main contents:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that six Cambodian students have been deported from the capital, Katum. Currently staying in Saudi Arabia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has decided to repeal the sub-decree on dolphin conservation issued in February 2023. But requires control of large cells and shock devices.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the conservation of dolphins is allowed to return to use the sub-decree in 2012. Samdech Techo considers this work as a reform work as well, especially the decision to affect the people is to be corrected.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the nation and its people have benefited from the policy of reforming power from the national level to the sub-national level.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the policy of devolving power to the sub-national level has enabled Cambodia to control the Kovid 19 epidemic.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in recent times, Samdech has given the Minister the opportunity to directly select officials, which is also a reform.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if we want to reform the institution, we must strengthen human resources. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that reforms must continue.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs the Royal School of Administration to make efforts to reform training.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech Sachkam was appointed by the angels to be the Prime Minister. Playing sports can be competitive, but it can not compete with karma or destiny.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs the Royal School of Administration to make efforts to reform and modernize training in response to the actual situation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded officials to remember that they are the faithful servants of the people, not the masters of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to encourage the recruitment of local officials to hold positions at the sub-national level.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen should not appoint good officials to run for office. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that justice must be given to local officials who work hard.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen suspects that some officials open the message of Samdech or the leaders to his beloved women to listen. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that some provincial governors lost their positions because of Srey Nhy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the success of the leadership of Samdech and other national leaders is a great contribution of his wife and children.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that officials are vulnerable to decisions. So as a leader, you have to be strong in decision making.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that Mr. Sar Chamrong may be arrested because of the false report of the Deputy Governor. But then Samdech grabbed the information and gave justice to Mr. Sar Chamrong.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is the enemy of the genocidal group but not the enemy of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there are still many reforms in the administration of the state, including judicial reform.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the reforms and decisions must take into account the interests of the people as a whole.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminds officials to work hard according to the law, do not remember the order or until Samdech shouts.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to remind to maintain security and order to avoid problems or accidents.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people to behave with dignity when hosting the SEA Games.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the non-collection of tickets, broadcast fees and the budget of the sports delegation is a demonstration of the broad scope of the Cambodian heart.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminds officials to work hard to develop their capacity to resolve disputes outside the judiciary and not to deal with land issues.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen considered Samdech's words this morning as the magic of self-defense of officials before continuing to serve the state.
