Samdech Techo Hun Sen is known as a politician with a low level of politics and high psychology, no one could have guessed his steps. Samdech has also stated that the predictions of Samdech steps are not correct, and that is why Samdech always wins things, especially politics.
Based on some of the above arguments, it can be concluded that the intimidation and threat to remove Sorn Dara's father and relatives was just pouring water to remove crickets from the hole, or it can be said that it was Sorn Dara's true character. Only.
According to previous interviews, both Sorn Dara's parents were very upset about their son's wrongdoing and behavior. Strive to nurture to grow well, strive to study highly, expect your child to become a dependent person in old age, but in the end you choose the path you do not want to not want to see. It hurts more, no matter how hard you try, you will not listen.
Should a person whose parents, the living God, possess the highest virtues in the world, not even respect him, be worthy of moral values? This is one thing that can give Sorn Dara a consideration for the general public.
In conclusion, the revelation of Sorn Dara's true lineage is the real direction of Samdech Techo in warning Sorn Dara to remove his father and relatives.
