(Kandal): The Royal Government, through the Ministry of Economy and Finance, has decided to provide compensation to 71 families, equivalent to 65 houses, which were demolished after the natural disaster, floods, and landslides in Prek Thi. Sangkat Rokar Khpos, Krong Takhmao recently.
On April 26, 2023, a total of 65 affected families, equivalent to 71 families, came to open the budget at Sangkat Rokar High, some families open more, some open less, depending on the size of the house and the condition of their house. With a valid letter measured by a professional officer.
