They asked Samdech Techo to help check the irregularities in the price of post-construction compensation, they have unequal compensation, some more than $ 140 per square, some more than $ 160, some more than $ 190. Originally, they did not seem to be satisfied after the construction of the same type of stone and construction close to each other, but received different compensation.
Please be informed that heavy rains from Kampong Speu province flooded the new canal into the Bassac River, causing people's houses to collapse into the canal on January 16, 2023.
Provincial authorities decided to dismantle all to prevent other risks arose by the force to dismantle the houses taken from 3 troops, a total of 600 people, dismantled 65 houses, equivalent to 71 families, stone houses, wooden houses, zinc houses and so on.
All the residents received the support of the Kandal Provincial Authority, led by Mr. Kong Sophorn, the Governor of Kandal Province. They will also receive a plot of land at Boeung Tote Toch while the authorities are preparing for them.
This means that under the guidance and mercy of Samdech Techo, the victims also received both real estate compensation and plots of land. This is the great spirit of Samdech Techo that the victims can not forget.
