The use of technology in mine and unexploded ordnance (UXO) operations has played an important role in achieving the vision of Samdech Techo Prime Minister Cambodia 202.
At the opening ceremony of the regional workshop, Senior Minister Ly Thuch spoke about the historical achievements for the field of mine action in Cambodia for more than 30 years under the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Prime Minister and set goals. Clear to solve all mine problems by 2025.
The use of state-of-the-art equipment in mine and UXO detection operations has played an important role in this progress and has been an essential part of achieving Samdech Techo's vision. At the same time, working together and using the latest technological advances will be able to accelerate the progress towards achieving goals and future without the threat of landmines and unexploded ordnance as soon as possible.
In addition, the Senior Minister considered Vallon GmbH to be an indispensable partner in the demining operations in Cambodia, and Vallon is a world leader in the production and development of advanced technology in demining operations. Mines and unexploded ordnance for humanitarian purposes.
Mr. Markus Vallon continued that VALLON GmbH has produced a variety of mine detectors with high efficiency and safety, and has received many improvements from Cambodia to improve the technology and now the company. Incorporate the Khmer language into this tool to make it easier for Cambodian deminers to use.
During the meeting, Mr. Osman Hassan, Chairman of the Islamic Movement Committee of the Cambodian People's Party, spoke about the history of the establishment of the Committee of the Islamic Movement Committee of the Cambodian People's Party. In 1998, this movement was established by the Royal Government of Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Techo Prime Minister.
He said that the Muslim Movement Committee has consistently implemented the highest leadership recommendations of the party president, Samdech Techo, and as a result in all election mandates, both the National Assembly election and the Commune / Sangkat Council election. Khmer Muslims voted for the CPP with a high percentage.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party, expressed his pleasure in meeting with more than 3,000 Cambodian-Muslims today. The Prime Minister also congratulated the recent successful completion of Ramadan by the Khmer-Muslim Brotherhood.
Samdech Techo expressed his appreciation for the participation of Khmer-Muslims in the development of the country with the Royal Government of Cambodia. Samdech Techo also thanked the Khmer-Muslims who have voted for the Cambodian People's Party in the past, and the election for the Cambodian People's Party is a contribution to maintaining the peace and tranquility of our entire nation. .
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said he was proud of the success of Cambodia's fight against Kovid 19. Samdech said that the measures of vaccination is the most important factor in preventing the fight against Kovid 19, with the participation of people across the country. In particular, Samdech Techo also thanked all partner countries for providing vaccines to Cambodia, especially China, which provides the most both aid and orders from Cambodia.
Samdech Techo further said that the victory over Kovid 19 provided an opportunity for everyone to regroup, especially in the past Vespers ceremony, gathered up to more than 6,000 people and also allowed to open The nation is back to normal as well.
Samdech Techo, the leader of the ruling party, also spoke about the recovery of the Cambodian economy after the Kovid 19 crisis, including tourism, services, etc. have begun to recover.
Samdech Techo also mentioned that Cambodia will become the emperor of cashews in the future and the Royal Government is pushing to export more cashews in the future.
Samdech Techo also called on the people who visit to see the order to maintain order in order to avoid interference that causes disorder and risk.
Samdech Techo Prime Minister continues to call on the people to participate in maintaining peace to continue to have peace and development. At the same time, Samdech Techo also asked to participate in maintaining macroeconomic stability and to participate in curbing inflation. All institutions must know how to save money in various expenses and must participate in eliminating tax evasion and must strive to earn more for the nation.
Samdech Techo also called for participation in maintaining security and social order, continuing to implement the policy of safe villages and communes, such as preventing drug trafficking and use, preventing all forms of gambling and jointly preventing traffic accidents.
