Cambodia Angkor Air has delivered the Vietnamese national football team to Cambodia.
(Phnom Penh): Cambodia Angkor Air is honored to transport special guests of the Vietnamese national football team to compete in the ASEAN Games "32nd SEA Games", a great sporting event in the Kingdom of Cambodia. Flight K6 813 departs from Tan Suan Nha International Airport, Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam at 08:30 am and will land at Phnom Penh International Airport at 9:15 am.
As a national airline, the company is honored to play an important role in transporting the Vietnamese national football team, athletes and other fans from all over the world to the event. With care from the pick-up point in Ho Chi Minh City to Cambodia, the team arrived safely, comfortably and on time as planned.
In fact, Cambodia Angkor Air is the first and only national airline in Cambodia to receive an IOS safety certificate from the International Air Transport Association (IATA). All passengers can fly with confidence because the company complies with the highest national and international safety standards and continues to provide a safe and comfortable flight experience on all Cambodia Angkor Air flights.
Thank you for choosing to fly with Cambodia Angkor Air, we wish all the athletes who came to compete in this big sport good luck and success. Join us in celebrating the 32nd SEA Games and the 12th ASEAN Para Games and travel through Cambodia Angkor Air for a comfortable and cozy experience in your stay in the Kingdom of Cambodia.
