What do experts see as Cambodia's economic benefits from hosting the 2023 SEA Games?
As the host of Cambodia, we have prepared and worked hard to organize the event well, and what is more, the head of the Royal Government has allowed all national and international guests to watch free of charge for the live broadcast. In other countries, along with not requiring all sports delegates to pay.
Economists see that the SEA Games, which Cambodia is hosting, will make Cambodia better known internationally, which can bring both direct and indirect economic benefits in the future.
"I am confident that the SEA Games will be solemnly broadcast around the world, which will make Cambodia known around the world in addition to what it used to be known, both in good terms and in a positive light," he said. And not good.
He said that after this event is over, Cambodia will become more prominent in the international arena, recognized, appreciated and interested in friendly countries or other countries in the West to cooperate. Operations in various fields with the Royal Government.
He said that the benefits that Cambodia will receive is the growth of tourists this year and in the years to come. In addition, it will be able to attract as well as receive more new investment projects with confidence from those foreign investors in line with Cambodia's potential.
The economist added that the event is also an opportunity for small and medium business owners to sell or present their products to delegates or foreign guests.
He added, "This is a great time and a long time to set up a booth to display various products made by local industrial handicrafts, which are the work of Cambodian children for foreigners to see. Will buy as a souvenir to be able to provide income to the economy. And if those products are attractive, they will still be ordering from Cambodian artisans. ”
He explained that Cambodia will benefit directly from the cost of visitors to the game directly on food, accommodation, travel and souvenirs.
In addition, Cambodia can also benefit indirectly. By organizing this event is the face of Cambodia, making the public in the international arena more positive for Cambodia, which leads investors to have more confidence in Cambodia as a country capable of doing big, stable and Peace. This will encourage Cambodia to get more business and trade ventures.
He sees that through this event will help promote the future tourism movement even better.
Thuon Sinan, President of the Asia-Pacific Tourism Association of Cambodia, said that for the SEA Games, some tour companies have organized tour packages for guests from ASEAN countries who wish to visit or support their country's athletes.
He said that now guests from other countries such as Singapore, Indonesia, etc. have gradually booked this package, while private companies are moving to increase promotion to more partners, especially working closely with Vietnam, Thailand, Laos nearby. Cambodia, which is easy to travel to Cambodia by car.
"I expect that as the SEA Games approach, the number of visitors from neighboring countries will definitely increase, especially when there is a football program that each country always supports," he added.
