Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants to teach directly to the officials of the Cambodian People's Party on three theories to be able to analyze the situation (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia this morning, April 25, 2023 He expressed the view that the analytical ability of some CPP officials is still limited and the prince wanted to teach three theories directly to the CPP officials in order to be able to analyze the actual situation.
During the graduation ceremony for more than 2,000 teachers, students and educators, Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the three theories that he wanted to teach to CPP officials were: materialism, science, materialism, history, methods Lead and work.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen compared politicians like doctors in case the assessment of the patient's condition is not correct, so when prescribing medicine is also incorrect. For politicians, too, if the analysis is wrong, the same wrong measures will be taken.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said, "There are three theories that have not been taught and I want to teach myself: first: materialism, ethnography, second: materialism, history, and third: methodology, leadership and work to put Foundations on analysis. "I want to lay the foundation for political scientists, policy makers related to analysis."
Samdech Techo Hun Sen claimed that the three methods that he always used in the analysis: the first method: materialism, the second, the historical perspective, and the third: logic.
