Remarks by Samdech Techo HUN SEN Opportunity to Present Diplomas to More Than 2,000 Teachers, Students and Educators
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Tuesday, April 25, 2023, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, presented diplomas to more than 2,000 teachers, students and educators. Successfully graduated from the National Institute of Education. The graduation ceremony will be held at the National Institute of Education.
During the graduation ceremony, Samdech Techo Hun Sen gave a talk for about 2 hours, the following are the main contents of Samdech:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commends teachers for their efforts to develop teaching skills from primary to secondary level to high school.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs the Director of the National Institute of Education to arrange the seats for the winners outside the hall more appropriately than at present.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that in the past, building teachers was difficult. In that, Samdech always gives lectures to prepare teachers before going out to teach students.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that after overcoming all difficulties in the past, the situation of teachers and teacher training has improved a lot.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this excellent situation is not due to the Royal Government or the Ministry of Education, but together for the development of the education system in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminds again, let the country establish itself as a democracy, do not make the third mistake. The two mistakes they have already made against Cambodia are: First, pretending to be a democracy but supporting the Lon Nol coup to overthrow Samdech Norodom Sihanouk, Second, pretending to be a democracy but supporting the Khmer Rouge regime Khmer people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian people do not easily forget the mistakes that democracy has made to Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the results of education in Cambodia now are meaningful results because they are the result of the efforts of the Cambodian people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that planting trees, people must dare to invest, if not dare to invest, can not benefit society.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that at the request of Mr. Yim Sinan's father-in-law, Samdech provided a new school building, a new office and a teacher's house for Hun Sen Chrey Ho Phnov High School in Veal Commune, Kong Pisey District, Kampong Speu Province.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that as the population grows, schools must increase.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed the expectation of working together on education for Cambodia towards a more prosperous future.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his desire to stand for election as commune chief when Samdech left the Prime Minister.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen encourages commune chiefs in communes to help organize housing for teachers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminds officials to go to the grassroots When going to the grassroots, do not let local officials gossip or complain.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in his political life, he broke three records: the youngest foreign minister, the youngest prime minister and the longest-serving prime minister in the world.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen Since the age of 25, Samdech has decided to stop listening to any politician and do everything only for the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants to teach directly to CPP officials on three theories, including: materialism, ethnography, materialism, history, methodology, leadership and work.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the wrong assessment of the situation could not be successful.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that for proper analysis, Samdech is based on three perspectives, including: materialism, ethnography, history and logic.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Bouyong Company provided funds to purchase 1,000 buses.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges lovers to get to know each other on the car while traveling to their hometown during the New Year, when getting married, please provide information to Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen suggested that the analysis of the national budget should not only focus on increasing salaries, but should be used to build school buildings to replace dilapidated old buildings and build new school buildings to meet the growth of students.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the past is over but has left many lessons for Cambodia that must work together to prevent Cambodia from going back.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that taking money from the SEA Games delegation did not make Cambodia rich. But not taking will make more people come to Cambodia and other countries when hosting the SEA Games may not take from Cambodia as well.
