The winners include: 66 education inspectors, 12 females, 181 master's degree students, 65 females, 2,005 higher education teachers in Formula 1, 937 females, basic education teachers in formula training. 12 plus 2 50 people, 36 females and 82 professional students of high school principals, 17 females.
Currently, the National Institute of Education has restructured its management by establishing postgraduate schools, pedagogical colleges, research and innovation centers, and general management units.
The National Institute of Education has 7 departments, 6 offices, 1 library, 2 practice schools, and a management team of 254 staff, instructors and teachers, 102 of whom are female, equal to 40.15%.
The National Institute of Education has renovated five school buildings using the state budget and plans to renovate nine buildings and build a six-story library building with a loan from the Asian Development Bank.
