Samdech Techo Hun Sen Sends Condolence Message to Dr. Hang Chuon Naron on the Death of Men Sa Un
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the night of April 24, 2023, sent a message of condolences to Dr. Hang Chuon Naron on the death of the great Buddhist disciple Men Sa Un, the mother of Hang Chuon Naron.
In this sad time, my wife and I would like to express our deepest condolences to His Excellency and his family for the loss of their mother, mother-in-law, grandmother, and deep devotion to all their children and grandchildren. In the past, in the life of the great devotee of Buddhism, Men Sa Un has strived to nurture, care for and educate his children until he becomes an intellectual and a valuable human resource for the society.
My wife and I would like to dedicate our prayers to the soul of the great devotee of Buddhism, Men Sa Un.
