Mr. Bikong Yean confirmed that his delegation came to Cambodia on the occasion of the 65th anniversary of diplomatic relations between the two countries, the two armies, the two peoples of China and Cambodia.
"The preparation of the 2023 Peace Angel Joint Military Health Exercise will show the world more clearly that Steel Friends can not separate China-Cambodia, has been carefully hidden "The previous generation of leaders of the two countries will continue to grow stronger for 65 years after the establishment of diplomacy, which represents a new kind of international relations."
Finally, General Ith Sarath also recommended to the technical team to organize the joint military health exercise 2023 Cambodia-China Angel of Peace through the visit to Cambodia of the delegation of the Chinese technical team.
