The appointment of Hun Kosal as Undersecretary of State at the Ministry of Land Management was made at the request of Cambodian Prime Minister Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
Please be informed that the opposition activist Mr. Hun Kosal on April 23, 2023 requested Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister and President of the Cambodian People's Party to live a political life with the Cambodian People's Party. Through a short video, he committed and showed loyalty to Samdech Techo and the Cambodian People's Party.
Mr. Hun Kosal also thanked Samdech Techo Hun Sen for granting Samdech Techo's mercy to get him out of jail. He also committed to contribute to the Royal Government in building a more prosperous nation under the leadership of Samdech Techo.
According to Mr. Hun Kosal, after 31 days in prison, he carefully considered the political path with compassion and emotion for the Cambodian people, which is why he decided to join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party. He added that the power and authority of Samdech Techo is an unforgettable value.
Please be informed that the Investigating Judge of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court on the afternoon of April 22, 2023 decided to release Mr. Hun Kosal on bail under the supervision of the court after being detained for insulting him. King and incitement.
Hun Kosal was arrested along with Yim Sinan on March 21 and remanded in custody at Prey Sar Prison after the two posted provocative messages on social media related to the signature. The King pays tribute to the 32nd Southeast Asian Games and the 12th ASEAN Para Games 2023 in Siem Reap on March 21, 2023.
Mr. Hun Kosal and Mr. Yim Sinan were charged with two offenses, including insult to the King and incitement to cause serious disturbance to social security under Article 437 (duplicate) of the Law on the Amendment of the Penal Code. 494 and Article 495 of the Penal Code. Hun Kosal was later released on bail after he released a video apologizing to the King and apologizing to Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
The decision to release Hun Kosal on bail came after Samdech Techo Hun Sen allowed Yim Sinan and his family to meet with him at his home in Takhmao City after a request to join the CPP. During the meeting, Samdech Techo Hun Sen allowed Mr. Lim Chea Vutha, Founder and General Director of Fresh News, to lead and coordinate Mr. Hun Kosal to meet with Samdech.
Prior to the visit, Mr. Yim Sinan also expressed his desire to request that Mr. Hun Kosal, a friend of his, be able to live on bail like him.
Then, on Sunday evening, April 23, 2023, Samdech Techo Hun Sen allowed Mr. Hun Kosal to pay a courtesy call and express his gratitude for allowing him to participate in political life with the Cambodian People's Party. Mr. Hun Kosal was also facilitated by Mr. Lim Chea Vutha and taken to meet Samdech Techo in person at his home in Takhmao City, Kandal Province.
Mr. Hun Kosal and Mr. Yim Sinan are close associates of Mr. Kem Sokha. Both men, formerly Kem Sokha, will confront Sam Rainsy as the two former opposition leaders attack each other after dissolving the CNRP in the past.
