(Phnom Penh): Banteay Meanchey Sports Center will cooperate in developing fitness programs for the Phnom Penh Gendarmerie, such as providing access to training facilities, equipment and trainers to the Phnom Penh Gendarmerie staff.
The Banteay Meanchey Sports Center will provide many opportunities to the Phnom Penh Gendarmerie, such as:
Provide access to training facilities, equipment and trainers for at least 6 Phnom Penh Gendarmerie staff with the aim of establishing Phnom Penh Gendarmerie trainers.
Train Phnom Penh Gendarmerie staff on the use of equipment for the gym and on the techniques and concepts of physical training, then the use of equipment on the premises of the Phnom Penh Gendarmerie.
Collect data and information based on the implementation of core activities and lifestyles of Phnom Penh Gendarmerie staff.
Communication, discovery and research of applied studies.
Develop a Unified Fitness Handbook that can be used throughout Phnom Penh for Phnom Penh Gendarmerie staff.
Provide assistance and oversight of the launch of test programs for fitness manuals.
Provides training for annual inter-military fitness competitions involving staff and available schedules.
Review all materials shared by Part A and provide feedback within an acceptable time, whenever and where necessary.
Maintain an appropriate record of all documents related to this program that are shared between the two parties.
