At the end of the program, Lt. Gen. Mao Sophan also handed out certificates to the trainees who completed this special military training course.
Senior Defense Ministry Official Denies Allegations on Facebook of Illegal Use of General Hun Manet
(Phnom Penh): A senior military official of the Ministry of National Defense, Major General Ban Prak, came out to dismiss the accusation on Facebook by linking his picture and the name of General Hun Manet to illegal use that caused harm. His honor and dignity as well as the General.
In a letter from his lawyer, obtained by Fresh News on the morning of April 22, 2023, the lieutenant general confirmed that a small number of individuals had named senior leaders such as General Dr. Hun Manet and The photo that you took to attack the social network Facebook is your client, please completely reject it.
He claimed that the photo was taken during a gathering and reunion of Cambodian families living in the United States and Canada on the occasion of the celebration of the Great New Year, April 8, 2023, which was organized. Made in Koh Pich in the past, he never took any photos or reputation or influence of General Hun Manet to use for personal gain.
If any person acts with the intention of slandering or blaming his client or continues to spread falsehoods through Facebook, he will take legal action.
