(Preah Sihanouk): Five Chinese nationals were arrested by Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police in connection with the case of illegal detention and extortion of the same Chinese person at a rented house on a concrete road after the company sent JNT Express (Upper Warehouse) Group 8, Village 3, Sangkat 1, Sihanoukville, while one victim was safely released.
Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police Commissioner Major General Chuon Narin told Fresh News this morning, April 22, 2023, that on the morning of April 11, 2023, the specialized force of Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police informed that An illegal kidnapping case has arisen.
Under the guidance of Major General Chuon Narin, the light penitentiary force, in cooperation with the Sihanoukville Police Inspectorate, conducted a thorough search until April 13, 2023, before arresting the accomplices. Three more suspects at a condominium, Village 1, Sangkat 3, Sihanoukville.
Currently, the above case, the Office of Minor Criminal Police is continuing the procedure.
