(Pursat): Pursat Provincial Administration on April 21, 2023 issued a notification on the postponement of the application for the recruitment of senior administrative officers to work in Pursat Municipality for 2023.
The notice is as follows:
Notification No. 1799/23, dated March 21, 2023 of Pursat Provincial Administration. Pursuant to the necessity of Pursat Provincial Examination Organizing Committee.
Pursat Provincial Examination Organizing Committee would also like to inform the candidates of both sexes that: Receipt of applications for registration for the recruitment of candidates for employment within the framework of senior administrative officers in Pursat Municipality The two candidates as advertised in the above reference will be postponed until May 5, 2023, the last day to receive the exam application.
At the same time, in order to ensure the smooth selection of the above examinations and to provide opportunities for candidates to participate in additional examinations, candidates with a bachelor's degree or higher in various related fields, including: Economic Management, Public Administration and Various skills are allowed to participate in this selection exam.
