(Phnom Penh): On the morning of April 21, 2023, Viettel Cambodia (Metfone) donated $ 100,000 to the Cambodian Red Cross. This is Metfone's annual event that aims to share, accompany and bring good value to the people and country of Cambodia.
Attending the donation ceremony were representatives from Metfone and the Cambodian Red Cross. This is an annual business activity and we will continue to support and accompany many other community activities in Cambodia.
In response to Metfone's sentiments, the Red Cross acknowledges and appreciates Metfone's support for the Red Cross. Metfone's support over the years has made significant contributions to philanthropic work and community activities for the benefit of humanity. At the same time, create conditions for the Red Cross to have more funds to organize various programs to serve the people and the country.
Metfone is one of the Cambodian Government's largest contributors with nearly $ 1 billion. In addition to contributing to the Red Cross, Metfone has also participated in a number of social activities, such as helping the tech industry, sponsoring community sports and social activities with more than $ 100 million.
