Minister of Labor: Cambodia is preparing a National Social Protection Policy 2030 (Phase 2)
(Phnom Penh): The Royal Government of Cambodia, through the National Council for Social Protection, which has 12 relevant ministries and institutions, is preparing the National Social Protection Policy 2030, which will be the second step of this policy in implementing the National Aid Program. Society and Social Security Regime.
It should be informed that the Royal Government of Cambodia has already launched the National Social Protection Policy Framework 2016-2025 (Phase 1) by helping to improve the income security of the people through the implementation of the National Social Assistance Program and the Social Security Regime. With high efficiency.
This was stated in the meeting to pay a courtesy call on providing input and important recommendations to the technical working group to prepare the National Social Protection Policy Framework 2030 on the afternoon of April 21, 2023 under the chairmanship of Mr. Ith Sam Heng, Minister of Labor and Training Professionalism.
At the meeting, Mr. John Narith, Undersecretary of State of the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training and Secretary General of the National Council for Social Protection, said that the development of the social protection system is an important factor to achieve equitable economic growth and environment.
Under the Secretary of State, on the basis of macroeconomic political stability and progress in socio-economic development, the Royal Government of Cambodia has set out the National Social Protection Policy Framework 2016-2025 by helping to improve people's income security through Effective implementation of national social assistance programs and social security regimes.
Minister Ith Sam Heng assessed that this social protection system is very important for the people and the country as a whole and requested the technical working group to develop the National Social Protection Policy Framework 2030 to make the social security system and social assistance system more responsive. Meet the needs of the people to support the people through the life cycle from birth to death.
The Minister also expressed support and continued to cooperate to provide the necessary inputs for the second phase of the National Social Protection Policy Framework to be comprehensive and complete in relation to the social security system that the Ministry of Labor and Training is implementing.
In addition to providing key inputs and recommendations, Mr. Ith Sam Heng also praised the efforts of the National Council for Social Protection, which has contributed to improving the lives of the people, keeping the resilience of the people strong under any circumstances. By.
The meeting lasted for more than two hours at Samdech Techo's residence in Takhmao City, Kandal Province.
During the meeting, Samdech Techo introduced and made many recommendations for Mr. Yim Sinan, a young politician.
The meeting took place after Yim Sinan posted a post on Facebook on the morning of April 21 with the most painful words, incomparable due to the careless actions of the opposition. On him when he was in prison. In addition to expressing unparalleled pain, Mr. Yim Sinan respectfully requested that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party and Prime Minister, please join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party.
Mr. Yim Sinan was arrested on March 21, 2023 after posting a provocative message on social media related to the image of His Majesty the King for the 32nd Southeast Asian Games and the ASEAN Games. The 12th Para Games 2023 in Siem Reap and was also detained by the court.
Later, on March 28, 2023, he was released by the Investigating Judge of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court after he released a video and wrote a letter apologizing to His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni. Of Cambodia and I apologize to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, regarding the insulting posts on Facebook.
