Murder! Son beats father to death in Prey Veng province's Kamchay Mear district due to drug effects
(Prey Veng): A 52-year-old man was beaten to death by his son in a pool of blood due to drug effects. This incident happened on the night of April 20, 2023 in Thlok Kandol village, Kranhung commune, Kamchay Mea district, Prey Veng province.
According to the local police report, the victim, 52-year-old Yon Chai Leng, lived in the commune where the incident took place. The perpetrator, 27-year-old Leng Barang, was a drug dealer.
Police said that before the incident, the son-in-law broke the drug, lost consciousness, pulled out a gas canister and hit his father, causing him to die in a pool of blood in the bedroom of the house. Meanwhile, the relatives of the family reported to the police to arrest the suspect immediately and build a case according to the procedure.
The corpses were arranged by the family and relatives for a traditional ceremony.
