In an interview with Lim Chea Vutha, Director General of Fresh News, Samdech Techo Hun Sen said, "Welcome to Mr. Yim Sinan for joining the CPP at his request and hope that Mr. Sinon will Become a valuable human resource of the Cambodian People's Party.
The welcome announcement of Samdech Techo Hun Sen came after Mr. Yim Sonon on the morning of April 21, 2023 wrote about the extreme pain of the opposition and respectfully asked Samdech Techo to join the political life with the party. Cambodian people.
The painful writing of Mr. Yim Sinan described with the following content:
"In terms of participating in my opposition politics for more than 12 years, as a leader in the youth movement in South Korea, I may be one of the thousands or tens of thousands who Always holding banner photos and shouting condemnation or demanding the release of victims, including journalists, civil society unions, and especially opposition politicians, including leaders and members of the current Candlelight Party.
In addition to expressing unparalleled pain, Mr. Yim Sinan respectfully requested that Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party and Prime Minister, please join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party.
Mr. Yim Sinan described in his full text:
Dear Samdech Techo Hun Sen, I really love and want to see Cambodia have a really strong democratic system in the style of Cambodia in accordance with the Constitution. But I really do not want to see a party or a group of fake democratic politicians have the opportunity to lead Cambodia. Therefore, I feel that it is my duty as well as every Cambodian citizen to be committed to protecting peace, stability and preventing attempts to destroy peace.
Mr. Yim Sinan expressed his deepest condolences for the actions of the opposition and respectfully asked Samdech Techo Hun Sen to join the political life with the Cambodian People's Party, wishing a happy new year and good luck to our compatriots both inside and outside the country. Thank you!
Yim Sinon, 54 students from Tbong Khmum Province Participate in Classroom Forum on Khmer Rouge History and Study Tour to Koh Thmor X-16 Military History Site
(Tbong Khmum): 54 students from Bun Rany Hun Sen Khnar High School and Bun Rany Hun Sen Krek High School, as well as students in Tbong Khmum Province, attended a class forum on Khmer Rouge history and visited the island military history site. Stone X-16, organized by the Koh Thmor Documentation Center team.
This class forum was held on April 20, 2023, focusing on the topic of "forced evacuation and massacre at Tuol Po Chrey."
Mr. Long Dany gave a presentation on the history of the Khmer Rouge (1975-1979) on the topic of evacuation from the city, forced evictions and the Tuol Po Chrey massacre.
(Phnom Penh): The brutal killer who beheaded a woman in a rented room in Bavet City, Svay Rieng Province was arrested by the Criminal Police Department of the National Police in cooperation with the Preah Vihear Provincial Police on the night of the 20th. April 2023.
The source added that before the police arrested the assailant, he was hiding in a guesthouse and took his own medicine. After the arrest, the police sent him to the 16th of January Referral Hospital in Preah Vihear Province and he could not be questioned due to the emergency situation.
The murder occurred on April 20, 2023, at a rented room on Kampong Spean Road in Bavet Kandal village, Bavet commune, Bavet city, Svay Rieng province.
According to the police report, the body of the victim was named Mon Srey Mey, 24 years old, an employee of DYNASTY Casino, his hometown is Kandal Krom Village, Banteay Dek Commune, Kien Svay District, Kandal Province. Bavet, Svay Rieng province.
