Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin: The Royal Government of the 7th Mandate Leading the Cambodian People's Party will implement a political program to bring great achievements to the nation and the people.
(Tbong Khmum): Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, Honorary President of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Tbong Khmum Provincial Party Assistance Working Group, presided over the closing ceremony of the Tbong Khmum Provincial Party Review Meeting in 2022 and 2023 on the morning of the 21st. This April 2023, at the party headquarters in Tbong Khmum district.
In this ceremony, Samdech Heng Samrin urged all members to continue to work hard to fulfill their special duties to continue to perform good deeds to serve the people in a timely and quality manner.
Samdech stressed that the success of the Tbong Khmum Provincial Party, in general, the success of the Cambodian People's Party in the upcoming election will bring the Royal Government of the 7th legislature of the National Assembly will run smoothly the political program that the party has put in place. The implementation has really achieved great achievements for the nation and the people.
Samdech Heng Samrin expressed his appreciation for the efforts of the working group leaders as well as party leaders at all levels who have worked hard, mentally and materially to work together to fulfill all the tasks set by the Party as well as the Royal Government. For Tbong Khmum province to develop in all areas, both socially and economically, to ensure the stability of people's lives.
"Based on the good deeds of party officials, the quantity and quality of party members to win the election" by ensuring the slogan "Strengthen the old, expand the new and turn one member into a party" From these efforts, the party has achieved great success in the past Commune / Sangkat Council elections.
In order to achieve further success in the upcoming 7th National Assembly election, Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin asked all members to work hard to maintain good social order in accordance with the Royal Village and Commune Safety Policy. Government of Cambodia. Prevent all attempts by the enemy to cause unrest in order to maintain the smooth running of the democratic process.
Increase attention on socio-economic development to improve people's living standards. Efforts must be made to properly implement all aspects of the Royal Government's social protection policy to help address the lives of the poor and vulnerable people.
Samdech Heng Samrin stated that the Royal Government led by the Cambodian People's Party, led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, has always taken care of the lives of people at all levels and in all circumstances, regardless of the epidemic and the economic crisis. The universe.
Please be informed that during the closing ceremony of the conference, the participants listened to the report on the party's work results in 2022 and the direction for 2023. Presenting the composition of the candidates for the National Assembly of Tbong Khmum Province for the 7th term.
