Oknha Kith Meng's letter states: "My wife and I, as well as the Vice President, Member, General Director, Staff of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce, would like to express our congratulations and happiness to Oknha Sok Sros, who was elected President of the Chamber of Commerce of Kandal Province - Kampong Chhnang, 3rd mandate, the first time, with the trust of the members who voted for him on the afternoon of Thursday, April 20, 2023.
This glorious success is a testament to the wise leadership, skill and high responsibility of the tycoon, who provided warmth to all businessmen in Nhang province for the Kandal-Kampong Chhnang Provincial Chamber of Commerce. Together with the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce, it is indispensable to actively participate with the provincial administration as well as the Royal Government of Cambodia to make the national economy develop proudly.
The senior minister added that 150 hard and soft infrastructure development projects have been incorporated into CIT-MP, which requires an investment of about 30 billion US dollars to be implemented over the next 10 years.
The Transport and Logistics Forum 2023 is organized by the European Chamber of Commerce in Cambodia with the aim of sharing up-to-date information on the development of transport and logistics infrastructure in Cambodia, as well as to discuss and exchange ideas with investors from the sector. The private sector has explored the potential and opportunities for high-quality development, which will contribute to the further development of the national economy.
"Do not hesitate to contact the government for support, because the success of the private sector is the success of the government as we are," he told investors and private sector representatives present at the forum. It is well known that economic growth and job opportunities come mainly from the private sector.
