(Phnom Penh): Mr. Huot Heang, Investigating Judge of Prey Veng Provincial Court, on the evening of April 20, 2023, decided to detain the accused Sean Bunnal, Deputy Inspector of Ba Phnom District, on temporary charges of aggravated violence. Using weapons under Article 218 of the Penal Code.
It should be noted that the accused Sean Bunnal, male, 26 years old, has the role of Deputy Inspector of Ba Phnom District in Svay Pok Village, Speuk Commune, Ba Phnom District, Prey Veng Province. The victim, San Vichka, a 36-year-old man from Prey Kdouch village, Chheu Karch commune, Ba Phnom district, Prey Veng province, was seriously injured in Vietnam.
The detention of Sean Bunnal comes after Prey Veng Deputy Prosecutor Chan Vanna decided to charge him with aggravated assault with a weapon and sent the case to an investigating judge for further proceedings. .
Please be informed that General Dr. Neth Savoeun, General Commissioner of the National Police, has ordered the suspension of the post of Deputy Inspector of Ba Phnom District, Prey Veng Province, and sent the case to the Provincial Court for processing after a firearm exploded, injuring a resident. In the operation to crack down on gambling offenses.
Police in Ba Phnom district, Prey Veng province, cracked down on illegal gambling (cockfighting) at Krous village, Chheu Karch commune, but during the crackdown, gamblers clashed with police, injuring one person.
According to the report of Prey Veng Provincial Police, according to Fresh News, on April 15, 2023, the police patrolled in Ba Phnom district to protect the security and order of the people on the occasion of Khmer New Year and prevent Cracking down on all kinds of crimes with a force of 4 people led by Lieutenant Colonel Seang Bunnal, Deputy Inspector of Ba Phnom District.
After receiving the information, Lieutenant Colonel Seang Bunnal led the force to the location and saw that many people were gathering to play gambling (cock), just saw the police immediately, the gamblers also brought Each ran wild.
Meanwhile, the Deputy Inspector shouted and pulled out a handgun to threaten them to stop, but they refused to listen, and the Deputy Inspector went to arrest 36-year-old San Vicheka in Krous village, Chheu Karch commune, Ba Phnom district. While riding a spare motorcycle, there was a fight that caused the Deputy Inspector and San Vicheka, including the motorcycle to fall, causing a gun to explode, injuring San Vicheka, injuring his left waist.
Commentary: The quality of the people is the real "soft strength"
BEIJING, April 19 (Xinhua) - The United Nations Population Fund (UNFPA) on April 19 released the "Global Population Situation Report 2023", predicting that India will surpass China to become the world's most populous country. The world's largest population in the middle of 2023. This is a result of population development laws, but some Western media outlets have bad intentions in covering the news.
China is the most populous country in the world. From reform and opening up, especially after joining the World Trade Organization, "dividends from the population" must be fully reflected, that is, the country is on the path of rapid development and the world He also got a win-win chance.
It can be seen that if we want to evaluate the future of China's development, we must not only look at the index of population size, but also the quality and efficiency of economic growth. In the first quarter of this year, China's economic growth was 4.5 percent, which exceeded external estimates.
At the same time, referring to structural changes in the population, such as the aging population and the low birth rate, China is actively implementing a national strategy to respond to the phenomenon of aging society and promote policies. Fertilization of a third child and related support measures.
In the past, some people in the West used Chinese population issues to cause trouble, but the facts have always been confirmed. This time, their inflated propaganda is useless, bringing this issue to the forefront will inevitably fail.
