The NEC decided to revise some of the content and agreed in principle on the documents related to the official results of the newly separated and newly formed municipal council elections.
(Phnom Penh): The National Election Committee (NEC) on April 20, 2023 convened a meeting chaired by NEC Chairman Prach Chan to review and decide on decisions related to the official results of The election of the five newly formed municipal and district councils took place on Sunday, April 9, 2023.
After reviewing and discussing each document in detail, the NEC meeting decided to revise some of the content and agreed in principle on those documents, including:
First, the decision on the announcement of the official results of the first election for the election of Arey Ksat Municipality, Sampov Poun Municipality of Kandal Province, Udong Mey Chey, Samaki Monichey District of Kampong Speu Province and O'Kreang Sen Chey District of Kratie Province.
