Tbong Khmum Provincial Governor said, "I would like to thank Samdech Techo Prime Minister for preparing 1,176 hectares of land in the military historical area of Techo Koh Thmor X16 to become a special economic zone to attract investors. To invest in Koh Thmor. This is a source of pride for the Tbong Khmum provincial administration, especially the people living in the Koh Thmor area will get many benefits if it becomes a special economic zone.
