Minister Pan Sosak Leads a Delegation to Defend the Draft Law on the Approval of the Border Trade Agreement between Cambodia and Vietnam at the 9th National Assembly Plenary Session of the 6th Legislature
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Pan Sosak, Minister of Commerce, on April 19, 2023, led a delegation to defend the draft law on the approval of the border trade agreement between the Royal Government of Cambodia and the Government of the Republic of Cambodia. Socialist Vietnam during the 9th National Assembly Plenary Session of the 6th Legislature, chaired by Samdech Akka Moha Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly.
To begin, Ms. Nin Saphon, Member of the Standing Committee and Chair of the Ninth Committee of the National Assembly, presented a report to the Ninth Session of the National Assembly of the Sixth Legislature on the study report on the request for ratification of the draft law on approval. Agreement on border trade between the Royal Government of the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Government of the Socialist Republic of Vietnam led by the Minister.
At the same time, she emphasized that based on the examination and study on the legal form and legal framework, the draft law on the approval of the border trade agreement between Cambodia and Vietnam was properly prepared in accordance with the provisions of the Constitution, laws and regulations. Relevant and in accordance with the Rectangular Strategy Phase 4 of the Royal Government, the 6th legislature of the National Assembly.
During the 9th National Assembly Plenary Session of the 6th Legislature, the Minister also informed the National Assembly Plenary Session on the main contents, objectives, benefits and implementation directions that Cambodia will receive at the time of this draft law. Effective.
After listening carefully to the report presented by Lok Chumteav, Chairman of the Ninth Committee of the National Assembly and His Excellency the Minister of the 9th Plenary Session of the National Assembly, the 6th legislature also fully approved the draft law on approval. On the border trade agreement between the Royal Government of the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Government of the Socialist Republic of Vietnam, with the approval of 94 votes.
