(Phnom Penh): Dangkor District Criminal Police arrested two suspects in connection with the seizure of a backpack from a man on the night of April 18, 2023 in front of the CPP, Sangkat Prey Sar, Concrete Road, in the village of twenty four communes. Prey Sar, Khan Dangkor, Phnom Penh.
Police confirmed that two suspects, Chim Reaksa alias Choam, 27 years old, false occupation, lived in a rented house in Anlong Kong Thmey village, Sangkat Prey Sar, Khan Dangkor, and Sek Chanratana, alias Boek, 20 years old, false occupation, living in a rented house in Anlong village Kong Thmey, Sangkat Prey Sar, Khan Dangkor. The victim, But Chivi, 46 years old, is a tricycle rider and lives in Phum Khva, Sangkat Dangkor, Khan Dangkor.
Prior to the incident, the victim was riding a red McVeigh motorcycle without a license plate, towing a tuk-tuk, his wife left his mother's house in Prey Leang village, Sangkat Pleung Cheh Roret, Khan Kampol, and returned to his house in Phum Khva, Sangkat Dangkor, Khan Dangkor. The victim was carrying a bag.
While traveling on the Prey Sar concrete road from west to east in front of the CPP, Sangkat Prey Sar, three suspects were riding three motorbikes in the same direction on the right side of the victim and then confiscated his backpack. The victim managed to escape.
At this time, the victim also drove a tuk-tuk to chase after him and shouted that he was a thief. Peam Sangkat Prey Sar, Khan Dangkor has just arrested two suspects.
After interrogation, the suspects confessed to the authorities that they had indeed seized the backpack and placed the victim's property, and the victim filed a complaint for the authorities to take legal action against the victim. Both suspects.
The UK's National Cyber Security Center (NCSC), part of the government's intelligence agency, said pro-Russian hackers had launched an online campaign that, although not a major threat, Those groups have been actively planning to inflict serious damage.
